  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNCT Coordination-UNDP-MYS-00069754</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project 00069754 UNCT Coordination was originally created as a project for RCO resources and its related activity. Initially, activities such as MDG, Gender, HIV/AIDS, Human Rights, and other activities was placed here. However as time move on, this project changed to become a management project for UNCT. Following the delinking process, there is no longer a need for UNDP to manage UNCT management resources. At the request of RCO, this project is being closed.</narrative>
  </description>
